{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38536","headline":"和座主尚书登布善寺楼 · 吴融","name":"和座主尚书登布善寺楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往事何时不系肠，更堪凝睇白云乡。\n楚王城垒空秋色，羊祜江山祗暝光。\n林下远分南去马，渡头偏认北归航。\n谁知此日凭轩处，一笔工夫胜七襄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}